[{"title":"南征二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"去年出师大冒山，五千步骑凯歌还。\n可怜今日山前月，又照漳南诸将坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20012,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"赣水西边是贼壕，年年楚越泣弓刀。\n天戈指处欃枪落，来岁徐看破尔曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20013,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望灵山","author":"郑善夫","text":"上饶县北香炉西，暮霭朝烟咫尺迷。\n平望灵山一百里，高南峰影入沙溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20014,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天姥行","author":"郑善夫","text":"天姥旁通天一门，下临绝壑桃花源。\n玉佩灵车杳然去，凤笙吹断越山魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20015,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤城怀太白山人","author":"郑善夫","text":"天台岁月轻刘阮，不见云端双玉箫。\n知尔西湖卧风雪，神游先到石梁桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20016,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昔余梦游雁宕乘最高台东观海波浩荡回望万峰蔚蔚云际及登盘山历历如在梦中竦然题句","author":"郑善夫","text":"昔年梦上百寻台，薄海鲸波天地回。\n四十九盘东向立，雁山犹是梦中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20017,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游吴兴二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"黄龙洞下云色深，霅水苕溪吏隐心。\n东道若逢孙处士，青春须寄岘山吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20018,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游吴兴二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"鸠兹城边望不稀，翠木朱藤罨画溪。\n津吏扬舲唱歌去，溪花十里使人迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20019,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天姥吟","author":"郑善夫","text":"山人住在天姥阴，忆余曾登天姥岑。\n云楼雪磴参差起，下控桃源几许深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20020,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京三首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"将军白马紫金鞯，接鞚联绥御座前。\n并誇异姓称皇孽，不用长缨系薁犍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20021,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京三首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"绯衣紫甲入东华，羯鼓铙歌散御花。\n边士尽骑天厩马，燕姬翻泣五云车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20022,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京三首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"山后干戈震朔州，君王按剑到边头。\n二月凯歌班士马，天闲遗却万骅骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20023,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逐客二首送刘伯儒侍御 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"黄衫白马簇金台，逐客飘飘去不回。\n莫向猿声堕清泪，铜环椎髻解怜才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20024,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逐客二首送刘伯儒侍御 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"尉陀城外汎云槎，西望峨眉隔水华。\n若道日南天万里，归心一夜过三巴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20025,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山人","author":"郑善夫","text":"税鹤停鸾去不分，玉箫瑶瑟散春云。\n日暮天花吹建水，曾孙重拜武夷君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新制白氎巾赠昆崙山人二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"细葛新裁白氎巾，风尘把赠武陵人。\n渔樵早晚相携去，五色瑶花好自纫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新制白氎巾赠昆崙山人二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"万里黄河天汉通，昆崙遥带碧琳宫。\n青牛已度流沙去，述作虚传河上公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹仲礼索巾云将归具茨兼柬王稚钦","author":"郑善夫","text":"元是山人白接䍦，云逵赠女莫相疑。\n便从梦泽穿嵩少，更历襄城问具茨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林茂贞大理二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"君今执法白门西，余亦将随倦鸟栖。\n黄箨为冠芰为服，几时停棹武夷溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20030,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林茂贞大理二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"武夷溪上水溅溅，东入沧溟天汉连。\n万里裹粮从汝去，乘槎直到女牛边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20031,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德十四年四首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"君王按剑东南征，锦障黄旗出凤城。\n矫矫六飞熊虎士，中原万里倚戈行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20032,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德十四年四首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"云中铁骑猎渔阳，鼙鼓填填夜未央。\n白马将军传号令，金盘宝箧进壶浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20033,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德十四年四首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"黄牌使者出行营，选舞徵歌倾卫城。\n报道儒生饬士马，南州叛贼一时平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20034,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德十四年四首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"桑黄渺渺蹑飞尘，清路人传天子真。\n宰相无须保车驾，至尊雄武动如神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20035,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀中歌五首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"巴东春水锦江来，流入荆吴万里回。\n楼船细逐江流去，不见瞿塘滟滪堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20036,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀中歌五首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"峡猿啼过下牢关，雪岭连天三百盘。\n锦官城外西游客，白日高歌行路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20037,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀中歌五首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"连云不断三危路，雄略犹残八阵图。\n巫峡剑门天地险，锦官白帝霸王都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20038,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀中歌五首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"瀼东瀼西花映渠，浣花草堂今有无。\n苦忆平生杜陵老，暮年涕泪满江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20039,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀中歌五首 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"文园尚忆马相如，锦水风云逐驷车。\n若道君王慕封禅，西京元有茂陵书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20040,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之岭南二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"蛮江春色接瑶京，江岸桃花流水声。\n他日双凫来谒帝，蓬莱宫畔笑相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20041,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之岭南二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"潮州东门鳄徙溪，行路萧萧猿狖啼。\n可耐曩时勾漏令，云车更度郁林西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20042,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巴人曲","author":"郑善夫","text":"蛾眉山色上青霄，白帝祠西巴路遥。\n二月巴江花烂熳，一声羌笛为停桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20043,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄安公石黄门二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"闻君久住成都市，岂为成都卖卜钱。\n万里桥西逢蜀使，问余何事女牛边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20044,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄安公石黄门二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"草玄亭下浣花溪，载酒看花随杖藜。\n青春不断黄牛峡，日日思君猿狖啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20045,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人下第归蜀","author":"郑善夫","text":"黄金台上草已芜，锦官城西花映渠。\n知君卖卜成都去，不羡风云驷马车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20046,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南望湖二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"湖上空波明綵霞，逢逢花鼓若为挝。\n云帆拟挟飞仙去，沧海惊传银汉槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20047,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄河二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"五月黄河风不回，六鳌东涌雪山来。\n乌樯天转蛟龙窟，未道瞿塘滟滪堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20048,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄河二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"桃源县前雷雨急，洪河拍天黄雾深。\n淮南古意正愁目，更着悲歌乱客心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20049,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璚州歌五章 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"青毡乌帽适天涯，白首投荒莫咄嗟。\n东傍扶桑多薏苡，南过勾漏有丹砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20050,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璚州歌五章 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"长鲸一涌雪山翻，海若爰居不可驯。\n知君定怕风涛急，白地风涛怕杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20051,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璚州歌五章 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"君家住近海门潮，君去朱厓不寂寥。\n哨哨罔两能人语，种种乌蛮解汉谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20052,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璚州歌五章 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"蛮子滩头兴不孤，桄榔树下打娵媀。\n年年五月荔枝熟，翻怪先生爱索居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20053,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璚州歌五章 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"岭表黎酋分鸟群，桂林象郡总能文。\n更怜蜃气朝朝见，莫厌猿声夜夜闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20054,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦黄山梅花","author":"郑善夫","text":"阳湖春动蕊珠宫，我梦黄山白鹤峰。\n罗浮仙子娟娟下，笑整云裳风雪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20055,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同王方湖泛舟鉴湖入兰亭偶成赠章二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"木落秦山近草堂，避人仍葺薜萝墙。\n知尔经纶数在手，钓船长系鉴湖傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20056,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同王方湖泛舟鉴湖入兰亭偶成赠章二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"鉴湖放船云雾光，兰亭八月溪水长。\n我爱风流王逸少，青山同引碧霞觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20057,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"若耶溪","author":"郑善夫","text":"山回水曲若耶溪，八月荷花光映堤。\n越女劳歌采莲曲，江南今有杜鹃啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20058,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剡溪","author":"郑善夫","text":"曹娥江接剡溪流，乱石幽花只漫愁。\n剡曲尚疑安道宅，山阴谁上子猷舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20059,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山柬董文玉谕德","author":"郑善夫","text":"东山中峰天汉连，紫筇丹屐共云烟。\n高卧正怀谢太傅，莫令小草后人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20060,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清风岭","author":"郑善夫","text":"嶀浦桥东云压山，清风岭矗明河湾。\n扪崖忽漫双流泪，日短风尘易满关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20061,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天姥峰","author":"郑善夫","text":"天姥崚嶒不可招，云岩雪壑傍丹霄。\n天台四万八千丈，俯看飞虹度石桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20062,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答天彝","author":"郑善夫","text":"君今笑入天台山，余亦欲田箕颖间。\n白日风传紫芝曲，莫教人识是商颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20063,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看花","author":"郑善夫","text":"山藤花开红映衣，看山藉草迟迟归。\n锦石无人溪水下，隔花刺船鸂鶒飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20064,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天台杂诗四首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"一夜雨声吹不断，国清寺前溪水鸣。\n欲过天台拾瑶草，秋风无限石梁情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20065,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天台杂诗四首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"赤城云闭玉真符，桐柏宫涵沧海珠。\n早晚移家葛洪井，璚台双阙是仙都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20066,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天台杂诗四首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"华顶数峰飞刺天，长风白日洒云烟。\n鹿裘行探金明草，笑拍洪崖星汉边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20067,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天台杂诗四首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"昙花亭前雷雨飞，石梁天巧眼中稀。\n素裾綦履沾云湿，我自天台华顶归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20068,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村","author":"郑善夫","text":"钱塘江浪拍天来，江上茅堂负郭开。\n蜃楼鼍鼓时能见，鸂鶒鸬鹚晚自回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20069,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青野堂成二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"飘风落木气萧萧，抱病经时亦自聊。\n湖上小堂驯燕雀，年来净业混渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20070,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青野堂成二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"子真谷口成深隐，少谷柴门故自开。\n药裹书签蒙不理，海鸥江鹳日相回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20071,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游淘江赠林樗翁","author":"郑善夫","text":"野亭杂花红近人，山翁爱客青纶巾。\n涉江欲采芙蓉去，无数秋风鬓发新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20072,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏作木虚据石图","author":"郑善夫","text":"云里孤峰尔独凭，下观星斗带沧溟。\n翻身笑折三花树，拟傍蓬莱顶上行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20073,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送克相侍御使齐鲁五首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"千盘岱岳矗琳宫，万壑平吹瀚海风。\n何能一探金鹅蕊，并尔呼云日观峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20074,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送克相侍御使齐鲁五首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"淄青南下沧溟开，鹏击鲸翻天汉回。\n东巡定上蓬莱阁，五色楼台万宝堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20075,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送克相侍御使齐鲁五首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"吾怜白浦控沧洲，目尽云槎天际流。\n傥遇阜乡双玉舄，与君高结望洋楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20076,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送克相侍御使齐鲁五首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"海内谈诗王秉衡，春风坐遍鲁诸生。\n我昔传闻薛吏部，为君遥式洛阳城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20077,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送克相侍御使齐鲁五首 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"槜李忻逢孟望之，湖边秋艇把杨枝。\n青袍笑入襄阳社，白璧翻传梁甫词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20078,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之莱芜","author":"郑善夫","text":"莱芜县在海东头，迁转还君山水州。\n日日鸣琴了公事，鱼龙波浪眼中游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20079,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠武夷道士二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"幔亭道士住紫宫，年过八十气吐虹。\n揖余解下双龙剑，指点云涯三百峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20080,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠武夷道士二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"武夷乱峰攒紫莲，丹房想在彩云边。\n分君一粟庖羲洞，閒弄明河抱月眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20081,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"郑善夫","text":"忽惊溪虎连群啸，不分林鸦朝暮啼。\n画省行台堪牧马，山城更鼓不随鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20082,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观马清痴所临元缪佚山泾杂树诗画戏为题句","author":"郑善夫","text":"吴下风流尽此物，后来好事更传真。\n尔辈安身是何处，素毫零落寄丰神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20083,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂山","author":"郑善夫","text":"浲水东行沧海回，衣冠玉帛万方来。\n后期独有防风氏，君看涂山戮将台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20084,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禹穴","author":"郑善夫","text":"脱屣行探禹穴灵，万年鸿宝秘丹扃。\n梅梁窆石空山里，想见虞廷旧典刑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20085,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹娥庙","author":"郑善夫","text":"东关东偏曹娥碑，今古流传绝妙词。\n洪涛骇浪翻沧海，要识人间孝女祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20086,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源","author":"郑善夫","text":"桃源红映赤城霞，洞口春开度索花。\n拟傍东方啖桃实，不随刘阮问胡麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20087,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石梁寄会稽王山人","author":"郑善夫","text":"石梁跨海与天通，千里骑驴识孟公。\n东路寄书王子晋，迟尔缑山缑氏峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20088,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"委羽","author":"郑善夫","text":"东海龟兹仙圣居，琅玕芝草洞天虚。\n函关已断青牛驾，委羽忻逢白鹿车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20089,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]